      "parent": "canvas",
      "children": [
        "shell_b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "shell_b",
      "type": "Group",
      "label": "Shell",
      "parameters": {
        "width": {
          "value": 100,
          "unit": "%"
        },
        "maxWidth": {
          "value": 1200,
          "unit": "px"
        },
        "sizeMode": "contentHeight",
        "flexDirection": "column",
        "rowGap": "var(--space-3)",
        "paddingLeft": "var(--space-6)",
        "paddingRight": "var(--space-6)"
      },
      "parent": "band_b",
      "children": [
        "b_heading",
        "b_body"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b_heading",
      "type": "Text",
      "label": "Heading",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "Clip Content anywhere above it kills it",
        "fontSize": "var(--text-2xl)",
        "fontWeight": "var(--font-semibold)",
        "lineHeight": "var(--leading-tight)",
        "color": "var(--foreground)"
      },
      "parent": "shell_b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_body",
      "type": "Text",
      "label": "Body",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "A sticky node sticks inside the box of the Group it is in, and only while every ancestor between it and the thing that scrolls is unclipped. Turn on Clip Content on the page column, or wrap the nav in a Group that is only as tall as the nav, and the band scrolls away with no error anywhere. That is the failure mode to look for first when a nav that should stick does not.",
        "fontSize": "var(--text-base)",
        "lineHeight": "var(--leading-relaxed)",
        "color": "var(--muted-foreground)",
        "maxWidth": {
          "value": 620,
          "unit": "px"
        }
      },
      "parent": "shell_b"
    },
    {
      "id": "band_c",
      "type": "Group",
      "label": "Band C",
      "parameters": {
        "width": {
          "value": 100,
          "unit": "%"
        },
        "sizeMode": "contentHeight",
        "flexDirection": "column",
        "alignItems": "center",
        "borderTopStyle": "solid",
        "borderTopWidth": "var(--border-1)",
        "borderTopColor": "var(--border)",
        "paddingTop": "var(--space-24)",
        "paddingBottom": "var(--space-24)"
      },
      "parent": "canvas",
      "children": [
        "shell_c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "shell_c",
      "type": "Group",
      "label": "Shell",
      "parameters": {
        "width": {
          "value": 100,
          "unit": "%"
        },
        "maxWidth": {
          "value": 1200,
          "unit": "px"
        },
        "sizeMode": "contentHeight",
        "flexDirection": "column",
        "rowGap": "var(--space-3)",
        "paddingLeft": "var(--space-6)",
        "paddingRight": "var(--space-6)"
      },
      "parent": "band_c",
      "children": [
        "c_heading",
        "c_body"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c_heading",
      "type": "Text",
      "label": "Heading",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "Sticky, not Fixed",
        "fontSize": "var(--text-2xl)",
        "fontWeight": "var(--font-semibold)",
        "lineHeight": "var(--leading-tight)",
        "color": "var(--foreground)"
      },
      "parent": "shell_c"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_body",
      "type": "Text",
      "label": "Body",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "Position has a Fixed option too, and it is the wrong one for a page header: a fixed band takes no space in the layout, so this page measures exactly one band shorter and the first section starts underneath the nav on load. Sticky keeps its place in the column until the page scrolls past it, so nothing is ever hidden.",
        "fontSize": "var(--text-base)",
        "lineHeight": "var(--leading-relaxed)",
        "color": "var(--muted-foreground)",
        "maxWidth": {
          "value": 620,
          "unit": "px"
        }
      },
      "parent": "shell_c"
    }
